# This build context should only ever ship the files COPY'd into the image.
# Ignore everything, then re-include exactly those files, so a stray secret/.env
# dropped into dev/src can never leak into the dev tier even if a future COPY
# widens its scope. Add a matching `!name` line whenever you COPY a new file.
*
!start-dockerd
!bashrc
!bash_profile
!my.cnf
